{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Meatsaw adds its flat damage after the weapon percent (#12867)",
  "contract": [
    "#12867: Meatsaw seemed to deal only part of its tooltip. Rank 5 578119 reads 'dealing $s2% Weapon Damage",
    "plus $s1': 56% weapon damage plus 143-178. Its DBC lists the flat effect (121) before the percent effect",
    "(31), so the engine multiplied the flat value by 56% too. The maintainer ruled that Meatsaw follows its",
    "tooltip, so the chain uses AscensionFlatAfterWeaponPercent (ADR 0010). An unarmed level 60 Knight of Xoroth",
    "with 400-430 attack power (416 measured) has 70-76 normalized weapon damage, so a hit before mitigation is",
    "182-220 with the flat value added in full and at most 142 when it is multiplied. The target lets 580-600 of",
    "1000 through its armor (591 measured) and damage-done and damage-taken modifiers scale it by 790-810 per",
    "1000 (800 measured), so non-critical hits must average 80-110; the multiplied form would average at most 69."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "k",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 17,
      "level": 60,
      "melee_hit_rating": 10000,
      "expertise_rating": 10000,
      "allow_regeneration": false
    }
  ],
